flowchart TB
    C([Clients]) --> LB[Load Balancer]
    LB --> GW[API Gateway<br/>+ Rate Limiter Library]

    GW -->|1. sync check| REDIS[(Redis Cluster<br/>sharded by api_key)]
    GW -->|2. if allowed| SVC[Backend Microservices]

    ADM([Operators]) --> CP[Control Plane API]
    CP --> STORE[(Rules DB)]
    CP -.->|push rules vN| GW

    GW --> MET[Metrics / Logs / Alerts<br/>allowed, denied, latency, hot keys]

    GW -->|deny| R429([429 + Retry-After])

    style R429 fill:#ffe0e0
